{"title":"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 12","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/0/db041d9c0fda44cf24b4f4ae7f02243ef2ea7f92.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ADE$\" width=\"59\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/1/061a8888e787aa55a4f70d1832673d0724113be6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\measuredangle ADE=140^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"113\" height=\"13\" />, points <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> lie on sides <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/5/bc56862b1fdb71204894da278e42ef75de73a40b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/6/9a65c05bd85d2609bea5db2b109ed5f556463511.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AE$\" width=\"27\" height=\"13\" />, \nrespectively, and points <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/d/60d3aceb48c0b97b786d49aff1b82fb6a5d5560f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A,~B,~C,~D,~E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"125\" height=\"16\" /> are distinct.* If lengths <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/c/14c8b39ceb13b284dedc2c83ca1052a8f4ef5361.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB,~BC,~CD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"113\" height=\"16\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/5/6d5c9afa92ae3180f02754c177e530d9d0f8b4d4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DE$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> are all equal, \nthen the measure of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/2/4f21512f8d2134f294558c03966bf24f39385fb8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\measuredangle EAD$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"56\" height=\"13\" /> is\n</p>\n<ul><li>The specification that points <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/8/9580b15ecb95e817f4cc6603baaa03ed71254759.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A,B,C,D,E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"103\" height=\"16\" /> be distinct was not included in the original statement of the problem.</li></ul>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/a/85ac5a80702d56577d4138e1ad27b0ed48ac3d2c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B=D$\" width=\"54\" height=\"12\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/5/fb5fbae4f24c87b4f86aa9572c31613ebd726a1e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C=E$\" width=\"52\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/d/15dbcdb4ee6234e174892bac96190a4176703d6b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\measuredangle EAD=20^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"104\" height=\"13\" />.     \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/3/cd305b9d50046ce435abc30e8e0675cae4c4a7af.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }5^\\circ\\qquad \\textbf{(B) }6^\\circ\\qquad \\textbf{(C) }7.5^\\circ\\qquad \\textbf{(D) }8^\\circ\\qquad \\textbf{(E) }10^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"413\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span